 = 0.5 mL/min. Within pump range (0.01-5.0 mL/min).\", \"temperature_C\": \"Hard constraint: 50 C.\", \"concentration_M\": \"Assumed 0.1 M for solubility and viscosity management in flow, typical for Suzuki couplings.\", \"BPR_bar\": \"1 bar (atmospheric) is sufficient for liquid-phase reaction at 50 C. No gas involved.\", \"reactor_volume_mL\": \"Selected 5 mL coil from inventory to match residence time and flow rate.\", \"light_setup\": \"Batch used microwave, not UV/Vis light. No light source needed.\"}, \"literature_analogies\": \"Suzuki-Miyaura couplings are commonly performed in flow with residence times ranging from minutes to hours. 10 min is short but feasible for activated substrates or high catalyst loading.\", \"engine_validated\": true, \"safety_flags\": [\"DMF is toxic; use closed system.\", \"Ensure no air bubbles in syringe to prevent pressure spikes.\"], \"confidence\": 0.8}"
